	(text "D1-D4 show the level on the serial output of U2, U3, U4 (QH') and the 165 return (QH);\nD5 shows 3.3 V. Use LEDs with Vf up to about 2.2 V (red, yellow, green).\nJ11: 3V3, buffered DATA, CLK, LATCH, end of chain, GND."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
